{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentSpan","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"type","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Span","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"type","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component type."}]}]},{"name":"body","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Receives the span; its result is returned."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The span covers every component of the type in storage order, which is not the creation order once components were","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"removed. It is zero copy: it views the storage itself. Because ","type":"text"},{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~Escapable"},{"type":"text","text":", it cannot leave "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(storing it in a variable outside the closure or returning it is a compile time error), so it can never dangle."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var maxX = 0","nexus.componentSpan(reading: Position.self) { (positions: Span<Position>) in","    for i in positions.indices { maxX = max(maxX, positions[i].x) }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence"},{"type":"text","text":": loop over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"indices"},{"type":"text","text":". Element access is bounds checked."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" runs the type is locked for reading: structural changes (creating or destroying entities, adding or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removing components, replacing a component with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"set"},{"type":"text","text":") and writes to the type stop the process with a message,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since they would move or change what the span views. Reading the component through the nexus and reading"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the type again are fine. Collect changes and apply them after the call."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty storage (or a type no entity ever had) passes an empty span."}]},{"text":"Storage","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Storage"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sparse-set storage keeps all components of a type in one array, so the span always views the storage itself."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The archetype storage keeps one column per table (one table per component set), so entities with different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component sets are not next to each other. If one table holds all components of the type the span views its column,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as above. If several tables hold them, the span views a temporary copy that is made table by table, which costs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one allocation and O(N) copying per call and is released after "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEachComponentSpan(reading:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to get zero copy spans, one batch per table."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1) plus ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS5NexusC13componentSpan7reading_q_xm_q_s0E0VyxGKXEtKAA9ComponentRzr0_lF","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"26.0"},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"26.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reading"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV","text":"Span"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"componentSpan(reading:_:)","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/componentSpan(reading:_:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gives "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" read access to all components of a type as one contiguous "},{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus\/componentspan(reading:_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus/componentSpan(reading:_:)":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"k